        "id": "easa-uspace-xml-2024:0db50106a4d5:ERULES-1963177438-21049:b0008",
        "title": "Article 6 — UAS operators",
        "text": "4.Before each individual flight, the UAS operator shall submit an UAS flight authorisation request to its U-space service provider, through the UAS flight authorisation service referred to in Article 10, in compliance with Annex IV.",
