      {
        "id": "easa-uspace-xml-2024:0db50106a4d5:ERULES-1963177438-21359:b0003",
        "title": "GM1 Article 10 UAS flight authorisation service",
        "text": "(a)The UAS flight authorisation service provides authorisations to UAS operators for each individual flight based on other notified flight requests that may conflict with other unmanned operations within the same U-space airspace. It is a strategic deconfliction tool. The UAS flight authorisation service is provided to a UAS operator under the condition that it has submitted the UAS flight authorisation request before the flight. The content of this request is detailed in Annex IV to Regulation (EU) 2021/664.",
        "source_id": "easa-uspace-xml-2024",
        "source_url": "https://www.easa.europa.eu/en/downloads/139565/en",
        "document_version": "May 2024",
        "source_checksum": "0db50106a4d58ab95f21228eef781ef63f5098b9c4550e7c15b2e9cfc42286a5",
