        "title": "Article 10 — UAS flight authorisation service",
        "text": "1.The U-space service providers shall provide UAS operators with the UAS flight authorisation for each individual flight, setting the terms and conditions of that flight, through a UAS flight authorisation service.",
        "source_id": "easa-uspace-xml-2024",
        "source_url": "https://www.easa.europa.eu/en/downloads/139565/en",
