        "title": "Article 10 — UAS flight authorisation service",
        "text": "11.U-space service providers shall issue a unique authorisation number for each UAS flight authorisation. This number shall enable the identification of the authorised flight, the UAS operator and the U-space service provider issuing the UAS flight authorisation.",
