        "title": "Article 6 — UAS operators",
        "text": "5.When ready to start the flight, the UAS operator shall request the U-space service provider for the activation of the UAS flight authorisation. Upon receiving the confirmation of the activation for the UAS flight authorisation from the U-space service provider, the UAS operator shall be entitled to start its flight.",
        "source_id": "easa-uspace-xml-2024",
